    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "cache_gets_total 是 Micrometer 对 Spring Cache 的自动埋点，标签 cache_manager 区分 redis 与本地缓存。\n命中率 = hit / (hit+miss)。若 miss 持续偏高，检查缓存 key 设计与 TTL 是否合理。\n下方的 cache_access_total 是业务自定义指标（CacheUtil 里注册），只有实际走业务缓存路径才出现，\n长期 No data 属正常——说明该实例没有发生业务缓存访问。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cache_gets_total{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (cache_manager, result)",
          "legendFormat": "{{cache_manager}} {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cache_gets_total{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\", result=\"hit\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(cache_gets_total{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "总命中率",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cache_access_total{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (result)",
          "legendFormat": "业务缓存 {{result}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "缓存命中与操作",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "堆使用率持续 >85% 时需调大 -Xmx 或排查内存泄漏。\njvm_gc_overhead 是 GC 时间占比，>0.1（10%）说明 GC 已影响吞吐；\njvm_gc_memory_promoted_bytes_total 反映晋升到老年代的速度，持续偏高通常是对象存活期过长。\n注意：本项目未启用 jvm_gc_pause_seconds 系列指标（需 Micrometer 的 JvmGcMetrics 显式开启），\n因此这里用 overhead 与 promoted 作为替代观察点。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 38
      },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\", area=\"heap\"}) / clamp_min(sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\", area=\"heap\"}), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "堆使用率",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(jvm_gc_overhead{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "GC 时间占比",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(jvm_gc_memory_promoted_bytes_total{application=~\"$application\", env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "晋升速率 (B/s)",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "JVM 堆内存与 GC",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "活跃连接 / 上限。>80% 需关注，接近 100% 会开始排队。",
      "fieldConfig": {
